<title>JAPAN: Catena to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Catena to buy back up to 1.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catena Corp said on Tuesday that it would buy back up to 1.5 million of its shares, or up to one billion yen worth.</p>
<p>Catena is a medium-sized company which sells personal computers.</p>
</text>
